  "changes": {
    "submission": "New capture and pre-submission preparation still require a quiet foreground epoch.",
    "submitted": "An immutable submitted request stays bound to the open context, its read revision, and the image identity and generation.",
    "verification": "Foreground callbacks proceed without waiting for the worker. Reply verification uses an idle opportunity and confirmed worker retirement.",
    "delivery": "Ready results survive unrelated read-only callbacks. Demand checks stored-record identities and reads independently on CPU if it arrives first.",
    "cache_limits": "The adapter retains one prepared read window. The worker retains one supervised request with its existing launch reservation and deadline."
